      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُوَافَةٌ</span></b>  (O, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُوَافٌ</span></b>  (K) The <i>prey which
the lion seeks</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَسَدُ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا يَتَعَوَّفُهُ</span></b> ) <i>by night, and
