       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (both words,
K) <i>A thing that becomes,</i> or <i>has become, an acquisition</i> of any one (O, K, TA) <i>by night.</i> (TA.)

